# app/.env.example — the Nuxt component's env CONTRACT.
# app/.env.example——Nuxt 组件的环境变量“契约”。
#
# This file declares what `app/` is allowed to read. It does two jobs:
# 本文件声明 app/ 可以读取哪些变量，有两个作用：
#
#   1. it scopes propagation — `./scripts/env.sh propagate` copies a key from
#      the root `.env` into `app/.env` ONLY if it appears here, so a backend
#      secret can never land in the frontend directory;
#      限定传播范围——仅此处声明的键才会从根 .env 复制到 app/.env；
#   2. the FORM says required-vs-optional, exactly as at the root — an
#      assignment line left UNCOMMENTED is required, one that is COMMENTED
#      OUT is optional and shows the default already in effect. (Stated in
#      prose because any name-plus-equals written in a comment here would
#      itself be parsed as a declaration.)
#      形式即约定，与根目录一致：未注释=必填，已注释=可选且展示默认值。
#
# `app/.env` itself is GENERATED and gitignored — never hand-write it. It
# carries the root file's checksum, `env.sh check app` reports `[stale]` when
# the root has moved on, and `dev.sh` refuses to launch on a stale copy.
# app/.env 是自动生成的且被 gitignore——切勿手写。它携带根文件校验和，
# 根文件变化后 `env.sh check app` 会报 [stale]，dev.sh 将拒绝启动。
#
# Why that matters here: an exported value WINS over this file (Nuxt's c12
# assigns only when the key is undefined in process.env), so a line here is
# live under `cd app && pnpm dev` but inert under
# `./scripts/dev.sh -C app pnpm dev` whenever the root also declares it. A
# generated, checksum-stamped copy is what keeps the two invocations agreeing.
# 原因：已导出的进程变量优先于本文件，因此手写副本会让两种启动方式行为不一致。

# The internal base URL of the Go API, including the /api/v1 suffix.
# Server-only: it populates runtimeConfig.apiInternalBase, which the SSR
# process calls directly and which the Nitro /api/v1/** proxy forwards the
# browser's same-origin requests to. runtimeConfig.public is empty, so the
# browser never sees it. The default below is correct for local dev — set it
# in the ROOT .env (not here) if the Go server lives elsewhere.
# Go API 的内部基址（含 /api/v1）。仅服务端可见；本地默认值已正确。
# 若 Go 服务在别处，请在根 .env 中设置，而非此处。
#NUXT_API_INTERNAL_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
